  "body": "Trace details of the concurrent calls within `_check_sigs_and_hash_and_fetch`.\r\n\r\nYou can see that we're missing where all of the time went in this `/messages` trace while backfilling (`_check_sigs_and_hash_and_fetch` took 10.41s, only processing 100 events):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"893\" alt=\"Breakdown of child spans in _check_sigs_and_hash_and_fetch in a Jaeger trace\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/558581/186028264-3b3a2e25-41c3-4a7a-9e45-47ee8aca71ed.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\nMore of the trace for context:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1725\" alt=\"_check_sigs_and_hash_and_fetch taking 10s in a Jaeger trace\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/558581/186027764-8e891902-6afc-4349-9874-ed278c1db13b.png\">\r\n",
